sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — MorphoEval overall 83.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1. Schnakenberg onset wavelength is fixed at 1.284e-05 m (12.84 µm, nominal 13 µm) for the Holocene singleton at 0 Ma. Dispersion Pearson is 0.9977. The colony GIF is specimen-conditioned, so specimen-match is 76. Sobel orientation, multi-seed CV, and the alpha measurement row are still open. Overall 83.8/100 (faithfulness 82.0, reproducibility 88.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit b24a05f4ebcbc6a5449b087683b1d06cc916db05; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.5.4, matplotlib Agg, Pillow 13.0.0, scipy 1.18.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 76, Parameter expressivity 86, Morphometric validation 84, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py at b24a05f4ebcbc6a5449b087683b1d06cc916db05, image/png, 275906 B, 1440×960 px, artifact_sha256 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd (sha256 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd), spec_fingerprint 8c34b8958cd42958d8cb0eb69ec1584db47478aa1296bac845f8f594052484e9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c34b8958cd42958d8cb0eb69ec1584db47478aa1296bac845f8f594052484e9; artifact_sha256: 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=6b16f2c6f118230e..., datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=282a45a621880a69...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952): diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg (1979): the a - u + u^2 v / b - u^2 v kinetics. | Adams, Wieser and Yu (1998) and Clutterbuck (1969): conidial pigment development in A. nidulans, without a reaction-diffusion wavelength. | Trinci (1974): radial hyphal-colony expansion.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian, trace, determinant, cross term, discriminant, k_c and λ_c = 1.284e-05 m on a periodic grid with D_v/D_u = 9.295. | Equal-diffusion ablation, D_v sweep of λ_c, and PDE mode-growth versus the analytical eigenvalue. | Colony observable I = S * (1 - α + α (0.55 + 0.90 û)) with α = 0.12, revealed by a radial front.; transfer_boundary: The 13 µm label is the slot detail scale, not a length measured on the colony photograph. The photograph does not resolve 13 µm. | (u, v) are not identified with the wA polyketide or yA laccase proteins.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the spiral colony was predicted ab initio. The photograph supplies the macroscopic optical density. | Does not claim a predecessor chronospecies. The series is 1/1 at 0 Ma; the only comparison is to the 10 µm tier floor.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Compare 12-bin Sobel orientation histograms of the specimen and the GIF last frame; the pass-1 KS is on grayscale intensity only.",
            "remediation needed: Export the α-coupling sweep into measure_morphoeval so parameter expressivity is in the measurement sidecar.",
            "remediation needed: Run the nonlinear integrator from at least three seeds and report the coefficient of variation of the measured wavelength." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.838"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (Cursor cloud agent, primary assessor, pass 1)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

